### Method reminder

Recall what the IOC does for the Olympic movement: it organises the Games and protects their values.

### Solution

Any two of the following:

- it organises the Olympic Games every four years (summer and winter);
- it chooses the host city of each Games;
- it promotes the Olympic values of peace, friendship and fair play;
- it supports national Olympic committees and works against doping.
